<title>UK: Fannie Mae sets $500 million five-year global bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $500 million five-year global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    09.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+54-55 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR FROM 09.OCT.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
